SUMMARY:Future Club: After School Program
DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday starting mid-August meet up in the Main Hall’s Green Room to do some homework\, meet new people\, and learn something new! Doors open at 3pm. Head to the community center after school to hang out\, grab a snack\, and eat some pizza! Ages 13-18. Questions? Reach out to Sean at youthprograms@seb.org. \nWednesdays\, starting in August\, 3 pm to 6 pm\, at the Sebastopol Community Cultural Center\, 390 Morris St.\, Sebastopol. Free.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/future-club-after-school-program/2026-08-05/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Cultural Center – Main Building\, 390 Morris Ave\, Sebastopol\, Ca\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Teens ONLY (13-19)
