SUMMARY:Reverse Appliqué: Upcyled Coasters
DESCRIPTION:Transform old T-shirts into a colorful\, one-of-a-kind coaster while learning the art of reverse appliqué. This beginner-friendly workshop combines decorative hand sewing with a creative approach to textile reuse. \n• Learn the fundamentals of reverse appliqué through layering\, stitching\, and cutting techniques\n• Create a one-of-a-kind coaster using upcycled T-shirts and decorative hand sewing\n• Leave with a finished project and the skills to incorporate reverse appliqué into future sewing and mending projects \nAll materials included. No sewing experience required. You’re welcome to bring two contrasting T-shirts to incorporate into your project.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/reverse-applique-upcyled-coasters/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/reverse-applique-Zokin.png
END:VEVENT
