SUMMARY:Macrame Plant Hangers
DESCRIPTION:Create a beautiful handmade plant hanger while learning the timeless craft of macramé. You’ll build confidence with the foundational knots and techniques that open the door to future projects. \n* Learn the essential knots and techniques of macramé\n* Measure\, tie\, and assemble your own custom plant hanger\n* Leave with a finished piece and the skills to keep creating \nNo prior experience required. Ages 10+ with an adult.
